3. **The wrong reading: partial, residual.** “Changed little” is present, but the paragraph leaves readers to compare 29,000 with 122,000 themselves. The household paragraph likewise lists changes without saying what their combination means. Those records were added after the earlier audit. Ask for the interpretive sentences, not more figures. [Led
4. **Two surveys: yes.** The first and last sentences of the marked paragraph carry the mechanism.
